  "issue": 404,
  "request": "Goal: prevent explicit flow target mismatch from executing another active flow.\nScope: entry handling for user-specified issue/spec/runId targets before dispatcher execution; target mismatch must stop before finalize, cleanup, repair, or step execution.\nOut of Scope: changing unrelated flow step behavior.\nDescription: When a user starts `$senti.flow #404` or another explicit target, the active flow target must be compared before continuing. If an active flow belongs to a different issue, spec, or runId, only status checks are allowed and execution stops with a clear message.",
